{"created": "2026-10-20T20:47:35.113168+00:00", "modified": "2026-10-20T20:47:35.843151+00:00", "id": 23512760, "conceptrecid": "23512759", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23512760", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.23512759", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23512760", "metadata": {"title": "HISTOR snapshot 2026-10-20: MCP tool definitions and how they change", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23512760", "publication_date": "2026-10-20", "description": "<p>HISTOR reads the tool list (`tools/list`) of every remote MCP server in the official MCP registry<br>once a day, and of npm/PyPI MCP packages run in a sandbox once per published version (new versions<br>first, a few hundred a day). It records the exact tool definitions,<br>pins them by digest, and writes a signed label to a public RFC 9162 Merkle log whenever a tool set<br>first appears, stays the same, or changes. This snapshot is that record as files.</p>\n<p>- **81,879** listed servers (31,040 remote endpoints, 50,839 packages), plus 2,078 delisted<br>- **38,126** with a recorded tool set; **9,340** changed at least once<br>- **23,821** recorded changes, 2026-09-24 to 2026-10-20<br>- **57,846** distinct tool sets (current ones and every one a change replaced)<br>- **636** servers with a block-tier WARDEN pattern match, **14,379** advise-only</p>\n<p>Live view and per-server pages: https://histor.modelmarket.dev &middot; code: https://github.com/alexar76/histor</p>\n<p>License and rights</p>\n<p>The compilation, digests, labels, scans and verdicts are CC-BY-4.0: cite \"HISTOR,<br>https://histor.modelmarket.dev, snapshot 2026-10-20\". Tool names, descriptions and schemas are reproduced as each server<br>published them; their rights stay with their authors. They are included so the definitions can be<br>studied and checked. A server operator who wants out: open an issue on https://github.com/alexar76/histor with the<br>endpoint or host. Opted-out servers are left out of every later snapshot.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Artamokhov, Aleksandr", "affiliation": null}], "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "23512759"}}]}}, "title": "HISTOR snapshot 2026-10-20: MCP tool definitions and how they change", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23512760", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23512760", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23512760?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23512760", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23512760", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23512760", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23512760/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23512759", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23512759", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23512759", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23512759", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23512760/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23512760/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23512760/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23512760/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23512760/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23512760/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23512760/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23512760/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23512760/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23512760/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23512760/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23512760/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23512760/access", "communities": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23512760/communities", "communities-suggestions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23512760/communities-suggestions", "request_deletion": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23512760/request-deletion", "file_modification": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23512760/file-modification", "quota_increase": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23512760/quota-increase", "requests": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23512760/requests"}, "updated": "2026-10-20T20:47:35.843151+00:00", "recid": "23512760", "revision": 3, "files": [{"id": "b3e987fd-7b2d-44f8-8ce5-990606b640cd", "key": "record-set.json", "size": 2357, "checksum": "md5:aa7f623a298c97545bd58fa991813379", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23512760/files/record-set.json/content"}}, {"id": "15b35840-3357-4d9c-bd05-be8b16f8dc9f", "key": "manifest.json", "size": 2630, "checksum": "md5:f152188c9ce357c381238fe9bf6cdd6b", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23512760/files/manifest.json/content"}}, {"id": "18f72b1d-b550-482d-a548-7a1078413be6", "key": "README.md", "size": 5189, "checksum": "md5:35d0c482b9bf272d48c005d185ddc233", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23512760/files/README.md/content"}}, {"id": "d86367c4-f83b-4dd3-8971-16ca1f422387", "key": "pattern-set.json", "size": 14633, "checksum": "md5:53f32aeef15d9ff1629e4b3289462fa5", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23512760/files/pattern-set.json/content"}}, {"id": "be1e8622-7c97-4d85-9816-8ace5b321567", "key": "changes.jsonl.gz", "size": 27974437, "checksum": "md5:650d85e85c7c6990bcb18373bc2a2306", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23512760/files/changes.jsonl.gz/content"}}, {"id": "c22f6396-7eac-48dc-bbde-6dcdc2e732b9", "key": "classifications.jsonl.gz", "size": 233590, "checksum": "md5:5f214337c45babb46f8b804ed47efc54", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23512760/files/classifications.jsonl.gz/content"}}, {"id": "617e3a96-ff3f-4ff5-93c0-248b17914a27", "key": "scans.jsonl.gz", "size": 1211768, "checksum": "md5:3f6770c08f3c7134a60e5b4c67c8351f", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23512760/files/scans.jsonl.gz/content"}}, {"id": "94e4ed30-58ac-4404-bc63-f37bae489f83", "key": "servers.jsonl.gz", "size": 16079771, "checksum": "md5:67440b27c7992d8460a2fbc715edffe6", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23512760/files/servers.jsonl.gz/content"}}, {"id": "060ab29a-95c6-4730-ac63-4800759c64fe", "key": "toolsets.jsonl.gz", "size": 377362655, "checksum": "md5:e86f15f6ae8469e193bf16266ab57bc4", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23512760/files/toolsets.jsonl.gz/content"}}], "swh": {}, "owners": [{"id": "1954651"}], "status": "published", "stats": {"downloads": 20, "unique_downloads": 18, "views": 70, "unique_views": 69, "version_downloads": 20, "version_unique_downloads": 18, "version_unique_views": 69, "version_views": 70}, "state": "done", "submitted": true}